WEBVTT

caption-01
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.667
I wanted to make animated videos.

caption-02
00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.333
LLMs could almost help.

caption-03
00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:02.000
But the results never felt alive.

caption-04
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.667
The workflow had too much friction.

caption-05
00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:03.333
Prompt, tweak, wait, repeat.

caption-06
00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:04.000
And somehow it still felt stiff.

caption-07
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.667
I liked drawing it more than generating it.

caption-08
00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:05.333
I wanted something handmade.

caption-09
00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:06.000
Sketch, colour, and animate in one place.

caption-10
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.667
That first spark became Inky.

caption-11
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:07.333
AI helps, but the artist still leads.

caption-12
00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:08.000
That is why I built Inky.
